        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Andy Muschietti, Andrés Muschietti, Megan Charpentier, Stephen King, Grumpy Cat\n- Films: Mama, Mamá, It, Grumpy Cat's Worst Christmas Ever\n- Roles: film director, screenwriter, actress, Victoria, Red Queen\n- Places: Argentina, Canada\n\nFacts:\n- Andy Muschietti, born Andrés Muschietti on 26 August 1973, is an Argentine film director and screenwriter.\n- Andy Muschietti is best known for directing the 2013 horror film \"Mama\" and the 2017 adaptation of Stephen King's \"It.\"\n- \"Mama\" is a 2013 English-language Spanish supernatural drama horror film directed and co-written by Andy Muschietti.\n- \"Mama\" is based on Andy Muschietti's 2008 Argentine short film \"Mamá.\"\n- Megan Charpentier is a Canadian actress best known for playing the feral child Victoria in the 2013 horror film \"Mama.\"\n- Megan Charpentier also played the new Red Queen in \"Resident Evil: Retribution.\"\n- \"Grumpy Cat's Worst Christmas Ever\" first aired on Lifetime on 29 November 2014.\n- In \"Grumpy Cat's Worst Christmas Ever,\" Megan Charpentier stars as a young girl who befriends and later adopts Grumpy Cat, then discovers that they can communicate with each other.",
